n></span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>（苯环上两个 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-COO-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">COO</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span> 处于对位），则该高分子的单体是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 对苯二甲酸（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HOOC-C_6H_4-COOH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HOOC</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">COOH</span></span></span></span></span>）与乙二醇（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HOCH_2CH_2OH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HOC</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">OH</span></span></span></span></span>）</p>\n<p>B. 对苯二甲酸二甲酯与乙烯</p>\n<p>C. 苯甲酸与乙二醇</p>\n<p>D. 邻苯二甲酸与乙醇</p>\n<ul>\n<li>常见缩聚物：<strong>PET（涤纶）</strong>（对苯二甲酸+乙二醇）、<strong>锦纶-66</strong>（己二酸+己二胺，酰胺键）、<strong>聚乳酸</strong>（乳酸自身缩聚）、<strong>酚醛树脂</strong>（苯酚+甲醛，脱水缩合）；</li>\n<li>常见加聚物：<strong>聚乙烯/聚氯乙烯/聚苯乙烯</strong>（只有一个碳碳双键的单体）、<strong>聚丙烯腈（腈纶）</strong>、<strong>橡胶</strong>（异戊二烯等共轭二烯，双键移位的&quot;1,4-加成&quot;、注意聚丁二烯链节中仍有双键）；加聚单体判断法：把链节主链&quot;每两个碳回一次双键&quot;，即主链全是碳碳单键的加聚物 → 单体是含双键的烯烃类；</li>\n<li>易错：A 选项的<strong>对苯二甲酸</strong> vs <strong>邻苯二甲酸</strong>（苯环位置不同，产物结构不同）；&quot;苯甲酸+乙二醇&quot;少了一个羧基，缩聚数不对應短链；</li>\n<li>变式：给<strong>单体</strong>问高聚物链节：把双键打开首尾相接 / 把羧基羟基脱水写—COO—；</li>\n<li>真题关联：有机合成与高分子为新课标化学选填/有机大题高频。🔗 真题公开资料：<a href=\"https://gaokao.neea.edu.cn/\">中国教育考试网·普通高考</a>（官方试题评析）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>第一步（判断聚合类型）</strong>：链节中含 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-COO-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">COO</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span>（酯基）→ <strong>缩聚产物</strong>（加聚物链节是碳碳主链，不会有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-COO-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">COO</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span> 残留在主链中）。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步（拆键补端基）</strong>：酯基 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{-COO-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">COO</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span> 来自羧基（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-COOH</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">COO</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span></span></span></span>）与羟基（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-OH</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span></span></span></span>）脱水缩合。把酯基拆开：</p>\n<p class='katex-block'><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi><munder><mo><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mstyle></mo><mtext>对位苯环</mtext></munder></mi><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>−</mo></mstyle></mstyle></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\mathrm{-OO\\color{red}C-\\underset{\\text{对位苯环}}{\\color{red}C_6H_4}\\color{red}-COO-}\\ CH_2CH_2-\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5777em;vertical-align:-0.8943em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">OO</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"color:red;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\" style=\"color:red;\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:red;\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\" style=\"color:red;\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2057em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\" style=\"color:red;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"color:red;\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\" style=\"color:red;\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\" style=\"color:red;\">对位苯环</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\" style=\"color:red;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:red;\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"color:red;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\" style=\"color:red;\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\" style=\"color:red;\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:red;\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"color:red;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vli