pan><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span> 连 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-CH_2CH_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）拆回羟基 → 生成<strong>乙二醇</strong> <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HOCH_2CH_2OH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HOC</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">OH</span></span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li>水分子作为缩合副产物忽略（链节补 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-OH</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span></span></span></span> 即可）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以单体为 <strong>对苯二甲酸与乙二醇</strong>，选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>&quot;切键补水&quot;口诀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;酯酰胺醚，一律缩聚：切、补——加水回去&quot;</strong>（酯基拆开：左边补 -OH 成羧酸，右边补 -H 成醇；四元环/链中间出现双键则加聚：断键补 H 或还原双键）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：缩聚是&quot;单体 + 单体 → 高聚物 + 小分子（水/醇）&quot;，反过来就是&quot;高聚物 + 水 → 单体&quot;——酯基水解就能还原成羧酸+醇，所以拆酯键并&quot;补全&quot;就是单体。</p>\n<p>30 秒出 A。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"某高分子材料的链节为 − O O C − C 6 H 4 − C O O − C H 2 C H 2 − \\mathrm{-OOC-C_6H_4-COO-CH_2CH_2-} − OOC − C 6 ​ H 4 ​ − COO − C H ","source":"自编（经典考法：有机物结构与高分子为新课标选填高频）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"加聚物在链节中\"双键消失\"（断键补 H 或还原出双键），缩聚物在链节中\"酯键/酰胺键/醚键断裂\"（补 H 或 OH）；判断\"是加聚还是缩聚\"先看链节中有无 -COO-、-CO-NH-、-O- 等特征键；缩聚物可能有小分子副产物（水/醇/氨），判断时可以大胆补回去。单体一定是\"能聚合的小分子\"，不一定是链节的一部分。","fit":["由高分子的链节反推单体（加聚/缩聚通用方法）","常见高分子材料（PET/尼龙/聚丙烯腈）","选填题"],"updated":"Tue Mar 04 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学"},{"slug":"organic","title":"有机化学基础"},{"slug":"derivatives","title":"烃的衍生物"},{"slug":"polymer-monomer","title":"高分子材料·缩聚物单体的判断"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"derivatives","title":"烃的衍生物","type":"knowledge"}]}